		<news>Beta 12: playback controls for filtered sessions (play/pause, seek, next filter interval, filter review and access to Kodi controls). Hiding the panel keeps filtering active. Parent Audit startup dialog cleanup and callback handling corrected. Category/timing changes still require restarting through review. The reported Glass Onion/CleanStream startup hang needs FireStick confirmation. Timing/coverage remain unverified; device and credentialed subtitle-download testing remain outstanding. Adult-only testing required. Repository updates preserve the separate Umbrella Family profile.</news>
